# Always check out text files with LF, matching end_of_line = lf in .editorconfig.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true (the default on Windows, including GitHub's Windows runners)
# converts files to CRLF and `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` fails.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.nupkg binary
*.snupkg binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
